    "html": "<main id=\"main-content\"><h1>APT command reference</h1><div id=\"manpage-content\"><h2 id=\"synopsis\" class=\"Sh\">SYNOPSIS</h2><section class=\"Sh\" id=\"syntax\"><p><b>apt</b> [<b>--help</b>]</p></section><h2 id=\"description\" class=\"Sh\">DESCRIPTION</h2><section class=\"Sh\"><p id=\"body1\" class=\"Pp\">This package manager provides a stable interface for everyday system administration.</p><p class=\"Pp\" id=\"command-label\"><b>future-upgrade</b> (see package options)</p><div id=\"mixed-command\" class=\"Bd-indent\"><b>future-upgrade</b> performs the requested upgrade while preserving installed package information.<p id=\"body2\" class=\"Pp\">When a package is supplied as an argument, it is installed before the upgrade action.</p></div><p class=\"Pp\" id=\"second-label\"><b>future-remove</b></p><div id=\"second-command\" class=\"Bd-indent\"><b>dpkg-query\n  --list</b> lists packages that are available on the installed system.</div></section></div></main>",
